 class="voice_icon"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6713971095c4a7cab5d924ee/671d482bd7c1176b65d3fed6_listen.avif" loading="lazy" alt=""/></div><div class="listen_article start">Artikel anhören</div><div class="listen_article stop">Hör auf zu hören</div></div><div class="play_line"><div class="active_bar"></div><div class="passive_bar"></div></div></a></div><div class="content_article"><div class="description_box"><div class="description_first">Imagine this: you’re swimming in crystal clear, turquoise waters, the sun is shining, and suddenly a few friendly pigs approach you, joining you on your aquatic adventure. Sounds surreal? On Big Major Cay, part of the Exumas island group in the Bahamas, this dream becomes a reality. The famous swimming pigs attract visitors from all over the world each year. Experience this unique moment and book your dream vacation with CHECK24—with recommendations from Travel Next Level for the best resorts and hotels.</div></div><div class="rich_part_1"><div class="w-richtext"><h2><strong>Where do the pigs swim?</strong></h2><p>The swimming pigs reside on <strong>Pig Beach</strong>, an uninhabited island in the Exumas, specifically on <strong>Big Major Cay</strong>. The pigs are friendly, accustomed to tourists, and love splashing around in the shallow, warm water. This unique activity is an absolute highlight in the Bahamas and should not be missing from anyone&#x27;s bucket list.</p><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="Grand Isle Resort, Great Exuma" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690e8761cbd11250fdfd3690_grand-isle-resort-exuma.webp"/></div></figure><h2><strong>1. Grand Isle Resort &amp; Spa</strong></h2><p>The luxurious <strong>Grand Isle Resort &amp; Spa</strong> is located on <strong>Great Exuma</strong> and offers everything you need for an unforgettable vacation in paradise. From here, you can easily take a boat tour to see the swimming pigs. The resort features spacious villas, an infinity pool with ocean views, and a private beach.</p><h3><strong>Amenities</strong></h3><p>Luxurious villas with private terraces</p><p>Golf course, spa, and infinity pool</p><p>Beachfront location</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Boat tours to the swimming pigs</p><p>Snorkeling in the colorful coral reefs of the Exumas</p><p>Excursions to <strong>Thunderball Grotto</strong>, famous from the James Bond film</p><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D605%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fangebot%3Fairport%3DBER%2CBRE%2CCGN%2CCSO%2CDRS%2CDTM%2CDUS%2CERF%2CFDH%2CFKB%2CFMM%2CFMO%2CFRA%2CGWT%2CHAJ%2CHAM%2CHHN%2CKSF%2CLBC%2CLEJ%2CMUC%2CNRN%2CNUE%2CPAD%2CRLG%2CSCN%2CSTR%26transportType%3Dflight%26roomCount%3D1%26adult%3D2%26roomAllocation%3DA-A%26departureDate%3D2025-05-11%26returnDate%3D2025-05-25%26days%3D14%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26hotelListId%3Db58b9ee2-281e-416a-b8c2-6079d8e7d148%26areaId%3D703%26dhs%3D24979%26ds%3Dh%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26extendedSearch%3D1%26oceanView%3D0%26hotelId%3D24979"><strong>Book your stay at the Grand Isle Resort &amp; Spa here</strong>: CHECK24 - Grand Isle Resort &amp; Spa</a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600pxpx" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img loading="lazy" alt="Sandals Emerald Bay, Bahamas" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690e877fa18cd8f11b4fd097_sandals-emerald-bay-exuma.webp"/></div></figure><h2><strong>2. Sandals Emerald Bay</strong></h2><p><strong>Sandals Emerald Bay</strong> is a luxurious all-inclusive resort located on <strong>Great Exuma</strong>. It offers couples a serene and relaxing atmosphere right on a beautiful beach. From here, you can book an unforgettable tour to see the swimming pigs while enjoying the comforts of an all-inclusive resort.</p><h3><strong>Amenities</strong></h3><p>All-inclusive concept with top-notch restaurants and bars</p><p>Oceanfront golf course and spa area</p><p>Luxurious suites and villas directly on the beach</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Day trips to see the swimming pigs</p><p>Diving and snorkeling at the colorful coral reefs</p><p>Exploring the hidden beaches of the Exuma Cays</p><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D605%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D703%26hotelId%3D24363%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%2CBRE%2CCGN%2CCSO%2CDRS%2CDTM%2CDUS%2CERF%2CFDH%2CFKB%2CFMM%2CFMO%2CFRA%2CGWT%2CHAJ%2CHAM%2CHHN%2CKSF%2CLBC%2CLEJ%2CMUC%2CNRN%2CNUE%2CPAD%2CRLG%2CSCN%2CSTR%26dhs%3D24363%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D14%26departureDate%3D2025-02-09%26returnDate%3D2025-02-23%26roomAllocation%3DA-A"><strong>Book your stay at Sandals Emerald Bay here: CHECK24 - Sandals Emerald Bay</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Peace &amp; Plenty Resort, Great Exuma" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690e87bd574c7b33c1040f90_peace-and-plenty-resort-exuma.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>3. Peace &amp; Plenty Resort</strong></h2><p>For those seeking an authentic and cozier accommodation, <strong>Peace &amp; Plenty Resort</strong> on <strong>Great Exuma</strong> offers the perfect retreat. This charming boutique hotel combines Caribbean flair with modern comfort. From here, you can also take boat trips to see the swimming pigs.</p><h3><strong>Amenities</strong></h3><p>Boutique resort with direct beach access</p><p>Outdoor pool and beach bar</p><p>Traditional Caribbean cuisine at the on-site restaurant</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Boat tours to Pig Beach to swim with the pigs</p><p>Kayaking and stand-up paddleboarding in the calm bay</p><p>Exploring the tropical mangroves and sandbanks</p><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D605%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FcountryId%3D18%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3Drating%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%2CBRE%2CCGN%2CCSO%2CDRS%2CDTM%2CDUS%2CERF%2CFDH%2CFKB%2CFMM%2CFMO%2CFRA%2CGWT%2CHAJ%2CHAM%2CHHN%2CKSF%2CLBC%2CLEJ%2CMUC%2CNRN%2CNUE%2CPAD%2CRLG%2CSCN%2CSTR%26ds%3Dco%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D14%26departureDate%3D2025-02-09%26returnDate%3D2025-02-23%26roomAllocation%3DA-A"><strong>Book your stay at Peace &amp; Plenty Resort here: CHECK24 - Peace &amp; Plenty Resort</strong></a></blockquote><figure style="max-width:1600px" class="w-richtext-align-fullwidth w-richtext-figure-type-image"><div><img alt="Hideaways Exuma beachfront resort" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67192adf47c16a59cea7d889/690e87e2d91f0aade78bb258_hideaways-exuma-resort.webp" loading="lazy"/></div></figure><h2><strong>4. Hideaways Exuma</strong></h2><p><strong>Hideaways Exuma</strong> is another excellent option for a relaxing stay on <strong>Great Exuma</strong>. This resort offers a laid-back atmosphere and comfortable bungalows by the water. It serves as the perfect base for exploring the Exuma Cays and visiting the famous pigs of Pig Beach.</p><h3><strong>Amenities</strong></h3><p>Beachfront bungalows with ocean views</p><p>Pool area and diving center</p><p>Family-friendly resort with plenty of recreational options</p><h3><strong>Activities</strong></h3><p>Boat trips to see the swimming pigs and explore the Exuma Cays</p><p>Snorkeling to discover Exuma&#x27;s <strong>Blue Holes</strong></p><p>Visiting the <strong>Exuma Cays Land and Sea Park</strong>, a marine nature reserve</p><blockquote><a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D605%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_2%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_3%255Bage%255D%3D-%26pid%3D788567%23%2Fsuche%2Fhotel%3FareaId%3D703%26hotelId%3D96908%26extendedSearch%3D1%26sorting%3DcategoryDistribution%26pageArea%3Dpackage%26offerSort%3Ddefault%26areaSort%3Dtopregion%26airport%3DBER%2CBRE%2CCGN%2CCSO%2CDRS%2CDTM%2CDUS%2CERF%2CFDH%2CFKB%2CFMM%2CFMO%2CFRA%2CGWT%2CHAJ%2CHAM%2CHHN%2CKSF%2CLBC%2CLEJ%2CMUC%2CNRN%2CNUE%2CPAD%2CRLG%2CSCN%2CSTR%26dhs%3D96908%26ds%3Dh%26transportType%3Dflight%26days%3D14%26departureDate%3D2025-02-09%26returnDate%3D2025-02-23%26roomAllocation%3DA-A"><strong>Book your stay at Hideaways Exuma here: CHECK24 - Hideaways Exuma</strong></a></blockquote></div></div><div class="rich_part_2"><div class="w-richtext"><h2><strong>Why you should swim with the pigs</strong></h2><p>Visiting the swimming pigs of the Bahamas is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity that transports you to an entirely different world. The crystal-clear water, pristine beaches, and friendly pigs create an unparalleled experience. In addition to the pigs, the <strong>Exumas</strong> offer breathtaking nature and exciting activities that will enhance your paradise vacation.</p><p>From boat trips to snorkeling adventures and relaxing days on the beach, the Bahamas is the perfect destination to create unforgettable memories. With <strong>Travel Next Level</strong> and <strong>CHECK24</strong>, you can easily plan and book your trip to swim with the pigs. Book your adventure now and experience paradise!</p></div></div><div class="rich_part_3"><div class="w-richtext"><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p>The swimming pigs of the Bahamas are a must-see highlight for anyone seeking an unforgettable and unique vacation experience. Whether you choose the luxurious <strong>Sandals Emerald Bay</strong> or the charming <strong>Peace &amp; Plenty Resort</strong>, <strong>Travel Next Level</strong> and <strong>CHECK24</strong> help you find the best resorts and hotels to enjoy your dream getaway in paradise.</p><blockquote><strong>Book your trip to swim with the pigs now</strong> and experience a truly special aquatic adventure:<a href="https://a.check24.net/misc/click.php?aid=18&amp;pid=788567&amp;target_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.check24.net%2Fpauschalreisen-vergleich%2F%3Fc24pp_departure_date%3D2025-06-01%26c24pp_return_date%3D2025-06-15%26c24pp_travel_duration%3D2w%26c24pp_airport%3DBER%26c24pp_region_id%3D605%26c24pp_adult%3D2%26c24pp_childrenCount%3D0%26c24pp_children_0%255Bage%255D%3D-%26c24pp_children_1%255Bage